NEXUS local run guide
=====================

Project folders
---------------
Backend:
C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend

Frontend:
C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Fronted

Security notes
--------------
Do not paste DATABASE_URL, SUPABASE_DB_URL, Supabase service role keys, JWT
secrets, or database passwords into this file.

The PostgreSQL database password is not the website login password.
The website login uses Supabase Auth.

Required environment files
--------------------------
Backend:
C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend\.env

Required backend variables:
DATABASE_URL or SUPABASE_DB_URL
SUPABASE_URL
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET or SUPABASE_JWKS_URL
ENVIRONMENT=development
ALLOW_DEV_AUTH_FALLBACK=false

Frontend:
C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Fronted\.env

Required frontend variables:
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://hwdpnsvwhszrijxzylem.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your public Supabase anon or publishable key>
VITE_API_URL=/api

Install backend dependencies
----------------------------
Open PowerShell:

cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend"
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -r requirements.txt

Run database migration
----------------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend"
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m alembic upgrade head

Seed application data
---------------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend"
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m app.database.seed

Provision or reset Supabase Auth demo logins
--------------------------------------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend"
$env:NEXUS_DEMO_PASSWORD='password'
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m app.database.auth_seed
Remove-Item Env:\NEXUS_DEMO_PASSWORD

Start backend localhost API
---------------------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend"
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m uvicorn app.main:app --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000

Backend URL:
http://127.0.0.1:8000

Backend health check:
http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health

Install frontend dependencies
-----------------------------
Open a second PowerShell window:

cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Fronted"
npm install

Start frontend localhost app
----------------------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Fronted"
npm run dev -- --host 127.0.0.1

Frontend URL:
http://127.0.0.1:3000

