missing the final "p".

Run backend tests
-----------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Backend"
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pytest -q

Run frontend build check
------------------------
cd "C:\Users\zians\Downloads\New Tactive\Fronted"
npm run build

Expected localhost flow
-----------------------
1. Start backend on http://127.0.0.1:8000.
2. Confirm /api/health reports database status ok.
3. Start frontend on http://127.0.0.1:3000.
4. Login with one of the demo accounts above.
5. Inventory, requests, approvals, fulfillment, reports, policies, settings,
   Copilot, admin, and AI engineering screens use backend API data.

Troubleshooting
---------------
If login says invalid credentials:
Run the auth seed command above, or create/reset the matching Supabase Auth user
in Authentication > Users.

If login succeeds but the app says the user is not registered:
Run the backend seed command again, then run the auth seed command.

If /api/health says the database is not connected:
Check Backend\.env and verify DATABASE_URL or SUPABASE_DB_URL is a PostgreSQL URI.

If port 8000 is already in use:
Stop the existing process, or start the backend on another port and update the
frontend API base URL intentionally.
